      ":question/problem": "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-6{x}_{3} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=- \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$",
